{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "mosart_routing",
  "description": "MOSART river-routing top-level component (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the cesm3.0-alphabranch mosart1.1.13 rof component as an esm 1.3.0 assembly, per the stage1/boundaries.md 1.5 boundary table and 2.6 subassembly mapping. Five systems: RofCap (mounted from ./mosart_coupling.esm, the med<->rof cap unit conversions), Hillslope (./mosart_hillslope.esm), Subnetwork (./mosart_subnetwork.esm), Channel (./mosart_channel.esm) - the Euler cascade of mosart_physics.F90 (hillslope -> subnetwork -> main channel, with the shared pointwise laws in ./mosart_templates.esm) - and the inline Control model, which is mosart_run (mosart_driver.F90:375-873) steps 2-8 written as algebraic rate rules over one coupling period: the irrigation withdrawal qirrig_actual = -min(-qirrig*coupling_period, wr)/coupling_period with the overage returned to qsub (F90:476-500), the flood rule flood = (volr - fthresh)/delt_coupling for mask==1 cells with volr = wt + wr + wh*area (F90:509-531, 854), the direct-transfer rules (frozen runoff, glc runoff, the qgwl_runoff_option all/negative/threshold branches, negative qsur/qsub, mask==0 cells; F90:533-772), the subcycling nsub = ceil(coupling_period/delt_mosart) with delt = delt_coupling/nsub (F90:786-800), the CFL sub-timesteps phi_r/phi_t and numDT_r/numDT_t of set_subtimesteps (mosart_tspatialunit_type.F90:624-684), the flow/runoff aggregation runofftot = direct + runoffocn + direct_glc with the mask==1/mask>=2 split (F90:844-867), and the ice_runoff branch of the rof_import_export export_fields (F90:362-382). The coupling array wires the data flow with variable_map param_to_var entries in the Euler order; the one network operation not yet wired is the rh_eroutUp upstream gather (erout of each cell mapped to the downstream cell's eroutUp, F90:158) and the rh_direct outlet gather - they are per-cell parameters (Channel.eroutUp, Control.direct_*) until the frivinp network data source lands (boundaries.md 2.4). The routing steps are written as storage ODEs whose continuous limit reproduces the Fortran's forward-Euler cascade; the discrete irrigation/flood storage jumps (wr -= irrig_volume, F90:497) are rate rules here and will become discrete events at stage 3. All fields use the standard CESM/CMEPS names; units are SI except the CMEPS surface fluxes (kg/m^2/s = mm/s). The Control tests block holds the one-coupling-period assembly trace over [0, 10800] from the cold start of the dumped run (cell 100312), pinning the mass-conserved volr, the hillslope fill wh, the subcycling diagnostics numDT_r/numDT_t/localdelt/nsub/delt, and the zero branches (flow, flood, irrigation, direct transfers), with the wt/wr continuous-vs-staggered scheme gap documented rather than asserted (see README.md (Testing)). Reference: stage1/cesm/components/mosart/src/riverroute/mosart_driver.F90 and mosart_physics.F90 (mosart1.1.13).",
   "tags": [
    "environmental_transport",
    "mosart",
    "river-routing",
    "hydrology",
    "cesm",
    "assembly",
    "coupling"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-26T00:00:00Z",
   "authors": [
    "EqESM project contributors"
   ],
   "references": [
    {
     "citation": "Li, H., Wigmosta, M. S., Wu, H., Huang, M., Ke, Y., Coleman, A. M., and Leung, L. R. (2013). A physically based runoff routing model for land surface and earth system models. Journal of Hydrometeorology, 14(3), 808-828. The MOSART (Model for Scale Adaptive River Transport) routing scheme these components transcribe.",
     "doi": "10.1175/JHM-D-12-015.1"
    },
    {
     "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CESM, cesm3.0-alphabranch: MOSART river-routing source (mosart1.1.13) - mosart_physics.F90, mosart_driver.F90, mosart_tstatusflux_type.F90, mosart_tspatialunit_type.F90, rof_comp_nuopc/rof_import_export.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
     "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CESM"
    },
    {
     "citation": "EarthSciModels - the authoritative .esm corpus this component lives in.",
     "url": "https://github.com/EarthSciML/EarthSciModels"
    }
   ]
 },
 "solver": {
  "stiffness": "moderate",
  "time_span": { "start": 0, "end": 10800 },
  "external": "mosart.run.json"
 },
 "enums": {
  "bypass_routing_option": {
   "direct_in_place": 1,
   "direct_to_outlet": 2,
   "none": 3
  },
  "qgwl_runoff_option": {
   "all": 1,
   "negative": 2,
   "threshold": 3
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "RofCap": { "ref": "./mosart_coupling.esm" },
  "Hillslope": { "ref": "./mosart_hillslope.esm" },
  "Subnetwork": { "ref": "./mosart_subnetwork.esm" },
  "Channel": { "ref": "./mosart_channel.esm" },
  "Control": {
   "variables": {
    "nsub": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "number of Euler subcycles per coupling period = ceil(coupling_period/delt_mosart) (mosart_driver.F90:786-789), [-]"
    },
    "delt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Euler substep = delt_coupling/nsub (Tctl%DeltaT, F90:790-800), [s]"
    },
    "phi_r": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "CFL diagnostic of the main channel = areaTotal2*sqrt(rslp)/(rlen*rwidth) (set_subtimesteps, mosart_tspatialunit_type.F90:639), [-]"
    },
    "phi_t": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "CFL diagnostic of the subnetwork = area*sqrt(tslp)/(tlen*twidth) (set_subtimesteps, F90:650), [-]"
    },
    "numDT_r": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "per-cell main-channel sub-timestep count: DLevelR*log10(phi_r) + 1 when phi_r >= 10, else DLevelR + 1, floored at 1 (set_subtimesteps, F90:640-647), [-]"
    },
    "numDT_t": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "per-cell subnetwork sub-timestep count: DLevelR*log10(phi_t) + 1 when phi_t >= 10, else DLevelR + 1, floored at 1 (set_subtimesteps, F90:651-658), [-]"
    },
    "localdelt_t": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "subnetwork local substep = delt/DLevelH2R/numDT_t (Euler F90:120), [s]"
    },
    "localdelt_r": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "main-channel local substep = delt/DLevelH2R/numDT_r (Euler F90:184), [s]"
    },
    "irrig_volume": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3",
     "description": "volume of the irrigation demand over the coupling period = -qirrig_m3s*coupling_period (F90:481), [m3]"
    },
    "qirrig_actual": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "actual irrigation rate removed from the main channel = -min(irrig_volume, wr)/coupling_period (F90:485-494), [m3/s]"
    },
    "qsub_i": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "subsurface stream after the irrigation overage return: qsub_m3s + (wr - irrig_volume)/coupling_period when the demand exceeds the channel storage (F90:486-487), [m3/s]"
    },
    "volr": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3",
     "description": "total water storage volr = wt + wr + wh*area (F90:854), [m3]"
    },
    "flood": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "flood flux sent back to the land: (volr - fthresh)/delt_coupling for mask==1 cells when volr > fthresh, else 0 (F90:513-517), [m3/s]"
    },
    "qsur_f": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "surface stream after the flood subtraction: qsur_m3s - flood (F90:527), [m3/s]"
    },
    "direct_neg_sur": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "negative surface runoff routed directly: qsur_f when qsur_f < 0, else 0 (F90:700-703, 736-739), [m3/s]"
    },
    "direct_neg_sub": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "negative subsurface runoff routed directly: qsub_i when qsub_i < 0, else 0 (F90:696-699, 730-733), [m3/s]"
    },
    "qsur_routed": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "surface stream entering the hillslope routing: max(qsur_f, 0) (the Fortran zeroes the negative part), [m3/s]"
    },
    "qsub_routed": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "subsurface stream entering the hillslope routing: max(qsub_i, 0), [m3/s]"
    },
    "qgwl_eligible": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "1 when the bypass routing option is direct_in_place or direct_to_outlet (the qgwl options act only then, F90:628-687), [-]"
    },
    "direct_qgwl": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "qgwl routed directly under the qgwl_runoff_option: 'all' routes everything, 'negative' routes only qgwl < 0, 'threshold' routes qgwl < 0 when qgwl_m3s*coupling_period + wr < river_depth_minimum*area (F90:637-684), [m3/s]"
    },
    "qgwl_out": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "qgwl stream after the direct-transfer removal: qgwl_m3s - direct_qgwl (F90:639-684), [m3/s]"
    },
    "qgwl_routed": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "qgwl entering the channel routing: qgwl_out, zeroed outside the basin mask (F90:706-713, 746-756), [m3/s]"
    },
    "direct_mask0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "water outside the basin (mask==0, ocean) routed directly: qsur_routed + qsub_routed + qgwl_out (F90:706-713), [m3/s]"
    },
    "qsur_ms": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "surface runoff in m/s feeding the hillslope step: qsur_routed/area (the F90:806-813 m3/s -> m/s conversion), [m/s]"
    },
    "qsub_ms": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "subsurface runoff in m/s feeding the hillslope step: qsub_routed/area, [m/s]"
    },
    "qgwl_ms": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "gwl runoff in m/s feeding the channel step: qgwl_routed/area, [m/s]"
    },
    "direct_liq": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "liquid water routed directly to the outlet: direct_qgwl + direct_neg_sur + direct_neg_sub + direct_mask0 (ctl%direct(:,nt_liq)), [m3/s]"
    },
    "direct_ice": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "frozen runoff routed directly to the outlet: qsur_ice_m3s (the Flrl_rofi stream, F90:595-612), [m3/s]"
    },
    "direct_glc_liq": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "liquid glc runoff routed directly (ctl%direct_glc(:,nt_liq), F90:565-589), [m3/s]"
    },
    "direct_glc_ice": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "frozen glc runoff routed directly (ctl%direct_glc(:,nt_ice)), [m3/s]"
    },
    "flow": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "reach streamflow (ctl%flow = -erout, the Euler accumulation and DLevelH2R averaging of F90:201,216 in continuous limit), [m3/s]"
    },
    "runoffocn_liq": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "routed runoff at outlet cells (mask >= 2): flow, else 0 (F90:861-863), [m3/s]"
    },
    "runofftot_liq": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "total liquid runoff = direct_liq + runoffocn_liq + direct_glc_liq (F90:856-864, 871), [m3/s]"
    },
    "runofftot_ice": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "total frozen runoff = direct_ice + direct_glc_ice, [m3/s]"
    },
    "rofl_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "liquid river runoff to the ocean in m3/s, ice_runoff branch of export_fields (F90:362-382): runofftot_liq - direct_glc_liq when ice_runoff, plus direct_ice otherwise, [m3/s]"
    },
    "rofi_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "frozen river runoff to the ocean in m3/s: direct_ice when ice_runoff, 0 otherwise, [m3/s]"
    },
    "rofl_glc_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "liquid glc runoff to the ocean in m3/s = direct_glc_liq, [m3/s]"
    },
    "rofi_glc_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "frozen glc runoff to the ocean in m3/s = direct_glc_ice, [m3/s]"
    },
    "flood_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "flood flux in m3/s = flood (ctl%flood, F90:516), [m3/s]"
    },
    "volr_m3": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3",
     "description": "total water storage in m3 = volr, [m3]"
    },
    "volrmch_m3": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3",
     "description": "main-channel storage in m3 = wr, [m3]"
    },
    "tdepth": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "stream depth (tributary depth yt) for Sr_tdepth (F90:399), [m]"
    },
    "tdepth_max": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "maximum stream depth = max(twidth0, 0)*(rdepth/rwidth) for Sr_tdepth_max (F90:401), [m]"
    },
    "qsur_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "liquid surface runoff stream from the cap, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qsub_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "liquid subsurface runoff stream from the cap, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qgwl_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "gwl runoff stream from the cap, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qirrig_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": -0.001,
     "description": "irrigation demand stream from the cap (negative), [m3/s]"
    },
    "qsur_ice_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "frozen runoff stream from the cap, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qglc_liq_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "liquid glc runoff stream from the cap, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qglc_ice_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "frozen glc runoff stream from the cap, [m3/s]"
    },
    "wr": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "main-channel storage from the Channel system (TRunoff%wr), [m3]"
    },
    "wt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "subnetwork storage from the Subnetwork system (TRunoff%wt), [m3]"
    },
    "wh": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "hillslope storage from the Hillslope system (TRunoff%wh), [m]"
    },
    "erout": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "main-channel outflow from the Channel system (TRunoff%erout), [m3/s]"
    },
    "yt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "subnetwork depth from the Subnetwork system (TRunoff%yt) for Sr_tdepth, [m]"
    },
    "area": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^2",
     "default": 10000000.0,
     "description": "area of the local cell (ctl%area), [m2]"
    },
    "frac": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "fraction of the cell included in the study area, [-]"
    },
    "mask": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "cell mask from fdir: 1 land, 2 outlet, 0 ocean (mosart_driver.F90:704-705), [-]"
    },
    "coupling_period": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 10800.0,
     "description": "rof coupling period in seconds (ROF_NCPL=8 over a daily base gives 3 h; boundaries.md 0.2), [s]"
    },
    "delt_mosart": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 3600.0,
     "description": "nominal MOSART routing timestep (namelist delt_mosart, default 3600 s), [s]"
    },
    "delt_coupling": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 10800.0,
     "description": "coupling period as a real (delt_coupling = coupling_period*1.0, F90:426), [s]"
    },
    "fthresh": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "water flood threshold (ctl%fthresh, read from the restart/network; spval-inactive by default, mosart_control_type.F90:388), [m3]"
    },
    "river_depth_minimum": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0001,
     "description": "gridcell-average minimum river depth protecting the qgwl threshold option (F90:401), [m]"
    },
    "DLevelH2R": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 5.0,
     "description": "base number of channel-routing sub-time-steps within one hillslope routing step (Tctl%DLevelH2R, default 5), [-]"
    },
    "DLevelR": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 3.0,
     "description": "number of channel-routing sub-time-steps at a higher level within one at a lower level (Tctl%DLevelR, default 3), [-]"
    },
    "rslp": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0001,
     "description": "slope of the main river reach (TUnit%rslp) for the CFL phi_r, [-]"
    },
    "tslp": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0001,
     "description": "average slope of the tributaries (TUnit%tslp) for the CFL phi_t, [-]"
    },
    "rlen": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 10000.0,
     "description": "length of the main river reach (TUnit%rlen), [m]"
    },
    "rwidth": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 50.0,
     "description": "bankfull width of the main reach (TUnit%rwidth), [m]"
    },
    "tlen": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 1000.0,
     "description": "length of all sub-network reaches within the cell (TUnit%tlen), [m]"
    },
    "twidth": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 10.0,
     "description": "bankfull width of the sub-reach (TUnit%twidth), [m]"
    },
    "twidth0": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 10.0,
     "description": "unadjusted tributary width (TUnit%twidth0) for the Sr_tdepth_max ratio (F90:401), [m]"
    },
    "rdepth": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 2.0,
     "description": "bankfull depth of the river cross section (TUnit%rdepth) for Sr_tdepth_max, [m]"
    },
    "areaTotal2": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^2",
     "default": 100000000.0,
     "description": "computed total upstream drainage area (TUnit%areaTotal2) for the CFL phi_r, [m2]"
    },
    "bypass_routing_option": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1,
     "description": "namelist bypass_routing_option: 1 direct_in_place (default), 2 direct_to_outlet, 3 none (enum bypass_routing_option), [-]"
    },
    "qgwl_runoff_option": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 3,
     "description": "namelist qgwl_runoff_option: 1 all, 2 negative, 3 threshold (default; enum qgwl_runoff_option), [-]"
    },
    "rof_from_glc": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "1 when glc runoff is routed through rof, [-]"
    },
    "ice_runoff": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "namelist ice_runoff: 1 separates liquid and frozen river runoff to the ocean, 0 adds frozen into the liquid stream (rof_import_export.F90:362-382), [-]"
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "nsub",
     "rhs": { "op": "ceil", "args": [
       { "op": "/", "args": ["coupling_period", "delt_mosart"] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "delt",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": ["delt_coupling", "nsub"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "phi_r",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [
       { "op": "*", "args": ["areaTotal2", { "op": "sqrt", "args": ["rslp"] }] },
       { "op": "*", "args": ["rlen", "rwidth"] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "phi_t",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [
       { "op": "*", "args": ["area", { "op": "sqrt", "args": ["tslp"] }] },
       { "op": "*", "args": ["tlen", "twidth"] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "numDT_r",
     "rhs": { "op": "max", "args": [
       { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
         { "op": ">=", "args": ["phi_r", 10.0] },
         { "op": "+", "args": [
           { "op": "*", "args": ["DLevelR", { "op": "log10", "args": ["phi_r"] }] },
           1.0 ] },
         { "op": "+", "args": ["DLevelR", 1.0] } ] },
       1.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "numDT_t",
     "rhs": { "op": "max", "args": [
       { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
         { "op": ">=", "args": ["phi_t", 10.0] },
         { "op": "+", "args": [
           { "op": "*", "args": ["DLevelR", { "op": "log10", "args": ["phi_t"] }] },
           1.0 ] },
         { "op": "+", "args": ["DLevelR", 1.0] } ] },
       1.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "localdelt_t",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [
       "delt",
       { "op": "*", "args": ["DLevelH2R", "numDT_t"] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "localdelt_r",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [
       "delt",
       { "op": "*", "args": ["DLevelH2R", "numDT_r"] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "irrig_volume",
     "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": [
       { "op": "-", "args": ["qirrig_m3s"] },
       "coupling_period" ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qirrig_actual",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [
       { "op": "-", "args": [
         { "op": "min", "args": ["irrig_volume", "wr"] } ] },
       "coupling_period" ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qsub_i",
     "rhs": { "op": "+", "args": [
       "qsub_m3s",
       { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
         { "op": ">", "args": ["irrig_volume", "wr"] },
         { "op": "/", "args": [
           { "op": "-", "args": ["wr", "irrig_volume"] },
           "coupling_period" ] },
         0.0 ] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "volr",
     "rhs": { "op": "+", "args": [
       "wt",
       "wr",
       { "op": "*", "args": ["wh", "area"] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "flood",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["mask", 1.0] },
       { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
         { "op": ">", "args": ["volr", "fthresh"] },
         { "op": "/", "args": [
           { "op": "-", "args": ["volr", "fthresh"] },
           "delt_coupling" ] },
         0.0 ] },
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qsur_f",
     "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": ["qsur_m3s", "flood"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "direct_neg_sur",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "<", "args": ["qsur_f", 0.0] },
       "qsur_f",
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "direct_neg_sub",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "<", "args": ["qsub_i", 0.0] },
       "qsub_i",
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qsur_routed",
     "rhs": { "op": "max", "args": ["qsur_f", 0.0] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qsub_routed",
     "rhs": { "op": "max", "args": ["qsub_i", 0.0] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qgwl_eligible",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "or", "args": [
         { "op": "==", "args": ["bypass_routing_option", { "op": "enum", "args": ["bypass_routing_option", "direct_in_place"] }] },
         { "op": "==", "args": ["bypass_routing_option", { "op": "enum", "args": ["bypass_routing_option", "direct_to_outlet"] }] } ] },
       1.0,
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "direct_qgwl",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "and", "args": [
         "qgwl_eligible",
         { "op": "==", "args": ["qgwl_runoff_option", { "op": "enum", "args": ["qgwl_runoff_option", "all"] }] } ] },
       "qgwl_m3s",
       { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
         { "op": "and", "args": [
           "qgwl_eligible",
           { "op": "==", "args": ["qgwl_runoff_option", { "op": "enum", "args": ["qgwl_runoff_option", "negative"] }] } ] },
         { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
           { "op": "<", "args": ["qgwl_m3s", 0.0] },
           "qgwl_m3s",
           0.0 ] },
         { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
           { "op": "and", "args": [
             "qgwl_eligible",
             { "op": "==", "args": ["qgwl_runoff_option", { "op": "enum", "args": ["qgwl_runoff_option", "threshold"] }] } ] },
           { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
             { "op": "and", "args": [
               { "op": "<", "args": [
                 { "op": "+", "args": [
                   { "op": "*", "args": ["qgwl_m3s", "coupling_period"] },
                   "wr" ] },
                 { "op": "*", "args": ["river_depth_minimum", "area"] } ] },
               { "op": "<", "args": ["qgwl_m3s", 0.0] } ] },
             "qgwl_m3s",
             0.0 ] },
           0.0 ] } ] }
     ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qgwl_out",
     "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": ["qgwl_m3s", "direct_qgwl"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qgwl_routed",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["mask", 0.0] },
       0.0,
       "qgwl_out" ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "direct_mask0",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["mask", 0.0] },
       { "op": "+", "args": ["qsur_routed", "qsub_routed", "qgwl_out"] },
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qsur_ms",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": ["qsur_routed", "area"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qsub_ms",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": ["qsub_routed", "area"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qgwl_ms",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": ["qgwl_routed", "area"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "direct_liq",
     "rhs": { "op": "+", "args": ["direct_qgwl", "direct_neg_sur", "direct_neg_sub", "direct_mask0"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "direct_ice",
     "rhs": "qsur_ice_m3s"
    },
    {
     "lhs": "direct_glc_liq",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["rof_from_glc", 1.0] },
       "qglc_liq_m3s",
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "direct_glc_ice",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["rof_from_glc", 1.0] },
       "qglc_ice_m3s",
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "flow",
     "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": ["erout"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "runoffocn_liq",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": ">=", "args": ["mask", 2.0] },
       "flow",
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "runofftot_liq",
     "rhs": { "op": "+", "args": ["direct_liq", "runoffocn_liq", "direct_glc_liq"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "runofftot_ice",
     "rhs": { "op": "+", "args": ["direct_ice", "direct_glc_ice"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "rofl_m3s",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["ice_runoff", 1.0] },
       { "op": "-", "args": ["runofftot_liq", "direct_glc_liq"] },
       { "op": "-", "args": [
         { "op": "+", "args": ["runofftot_liq", "direct_ice"] },
         "direct_glc_liq" ] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "rofi_m3s",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["ice_runoff", 1.0] },
       "direct_ice",
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "rofl_glc_m3s",
     "rhs": "direct_glc_liq"
    },
    {
     "lhs": "rofi_glc_m3s",
     "rhs": "direct_glc_ice"
    },
    {
     "lhs": "flood_m3s",
     "rhs": "flood"
    },
    {
     "lhs": "volr_m3",
     "rhs": "volr"
    },
    {
     "lhs": "volrmch_m3",
     "rhs": "wr"
    },
    {
     "lhs": "tdepth",
     "rhs": "yt"
    },
    {
     "lhs": "tdepth_max",
     "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": [
       { "op": "max", "args": ["twidth0", 0.0] },
       { "op": "/", "args": ["rdepth", "rwidth"] } ] }
    }
   ],
   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "coupling_step1_cell100312",
     "description": "One-coupling-period trace of the full assembly over [0, 10800] (the ROF_NCPL=8 coupling period) from the cold start of mosart_run_imports.csv row (step 1, nt 1, gindex 100312): all storages zero, qsur = 7.51365591037279353e-05 m3/s (delivered through the cap as Flrl_rofsur = 2.59072497089951852e-11 mm/s over area = 2.900213644740529e9 m2), qsub = qgwl = qirrig = qglc = 0, mask = 1, fthresh = 1e36 (the Fortran flood threshold is the spval sentinel, mosart_vars.F90:24, not the 0.0 placeholder default; with the placeholder the flood rule would fire on the first period). Cell-100312 geometry for the three routing systems; the CFL defaults (rslp = tslp = 1e-4, areaTotal2 = 1e8) give numDT_r = numDT_t = 4 and localdelt = 180 s, matching the substep multiplicities of the gr/crvrman dumps, and nsub = ceil(10800/3600) = 3, delt = 3600 s, matching the three ns levels of the mosart_euler.csv dump rows per coupling step. End-of-period states of mosart_run_exports.csv row (1,1,100312): volr = 8.11474838320261793e-01 m3 (asserted: the continuous assembly conserves water exactly - the .esm subnetwork drains erlateral = -etout while d(wt)/dt = etin + etout, so d(volr)/dt = qsur with a dry channel, and the measured continuous end state 0.8114748383202616 m3 differs from the Fortran by 1.9e-16 m3 = 2.4e-16 rel) and wh = 2.79797873884816915e-10 m (asserted with rel 1e-5: the measured continuous end state 2.7979758559479384e-10 m trails the Fortran by 2.9e-16 m = 1.0e-6 rel, the second-order effect of the Fortran's staggered ehout on the otherwise qsur-dominated hillslope fill). The subnetwork and channel storages are a documented scheme gap, not asserted: the assembly delivers the hillslope outflow etin as a continuous ramp while the Fortran holds it constant at each Euler substep's entry state, so the measured continuous end states (solver at reltol 1e-14) wt = 2.0628127835562434e-06 m3 and wr = 8.523256587208812e-16 m3 sit above the Fortran's wt = 1.22671012572302206e-06 m3 (0.59x) and wr = 2.61999638886733984e-16 m3 (3.3x); wt is therefore not asserted, and wr is asserted only to the dry-channel threshold (|wr| < 1e-14 m3, both values being far below the TINYVALUE = 1e-14 wetted-area cutoff that would wake the channel flow). The zero branches of the period are pinned: flow, runofftot_liq, flood, qirrig_actual, direct_liq, rofl_m3s all stay 0 (dry channel, volr < fthresh, no direct transfers).",
     "time_span": {"start": 0.0, "end": 10800.0},
     "parameter_overrides": {
      "RofCap.Flrl_rofsur": 2.5907249708995185e-11,
      "RofCap.Flrl_irrig": 0.0,
      "RofCap.area": 2900213644.740529,
      "Control.area": 2900213644.740529,
      "Control.mask": 1.0,
      "Control.fthresh": 1e+36,
      "Control.rlen": 144889.1719,
      "Control.rwidth": 93.9573745727539,
      "Control.tlen": 8341.719766593531,
      "Control.twidth": 8168.043717446656,
      "Hillslope.hslpsqrt": 0.3788139384975162,
      "Hillslope.nh": 0.07745444774627686,
      "Hillslope.Gxr": 0.0003,
      "Hillslope.area": 2900213644.740529,
      "Subnetwork.tslpsqrt": 0.099498743710662,
      "Subnetwork.nt": 0.05000000074505806,
      "Subnetwork.tlen": 8341.719766593531,
      "Subnetwork.twidth": 8168.043717446656,
      "Channel.rslpsqrt": 0.099498743710662,
      "Channel.nr": 0.05000000074505806,
      "Channel.rlen": 144889.1719,
      "Channel.rwidth": 93.9573745727539,
      "Channel.rwidth0": 469.78687286376953,
      "Channel.rdepth": 2.0,
      "Channel.area": 2900213644.740529
     },
     "initial_conditions": {
      "Hillslope.wh": 0.0,
      "Subnetwork.wt": 0.0,
      "Channel.wr": 0.0
     },
     "tolerance": {"rel": 1e-05, "abs": 1e-16},
     "assertions": [
      {"variable": "Control.volr", "time": 10800.0, "expected": 0.8114748383202617},
      {"variable": "Hillslope.wh", "time": 10800.0, "expected": 2.797978738848169e-10},
      {
       "variable": "Channel.wr",
       "time": 10800.0,
       "expected": 0.0,
       "tolerance": {"rel": 1e-05, "abs": 1e-14}
      },
      {"variable": "Control.nsub", "time": 0.0, "expected": 3.0},
      {"variable": "Control.delt", "time": 0.0, "expected": 3600.0},
      {"variable": "Control.numDT_r", "time": 0.0, "expected": 4.0},
      {"variable": "Control.numDT_t", "time": 0.0, "expected": 4.0},
      {"variable": "Control.localdelt_r", "time": 0.0, "expected": 180.0},
      {"variable": "Control.localdelt_t", "time": 0.0, "expected": 180.0},
      {"variable": "Control.qsur_ms", "time": 0.0, "expected": 2.5907249708995185e-14},
      {"variable": "Control.flow", "time": 10800.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Control.runofftot_liq", "time": 10800.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Control.flood", "time": 10800.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Control.qirrig_actual", "time": 10800.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Control.direct_liq", "time": 10800.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Control.rofl_m3s", "time": 10800.0, "expected": 0.0}
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 },
 "coupling": [
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "RofCap.qsur_m3s",
   "to": "Control.qsur_m3s",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "cap surface-runoff stream into the orchestration (mosart_run step 1)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "RofCap.qsub_m3s",
   "to": "Control.qsub_m3s",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "cap subsurface-runoff stream into the orchestration"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "RofCap.qgwl_m3s",
   "to": "Control.qgwl_m3s",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "cap gwl-runoff stream into the orchestration"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "RofCap.qirrig_m3s",
   "to": "Control.qirrig_m3s",
